  // y component), decodes and the two call sites needing a real
  // rigid-body-impact resolve their casts automatically. The raw stack
  // address's own type never resolved on its own ("Failed to guess stack
  // use for 16").
  "(method 83 rigid-body-object)": [[16, ["inline-array", "vector", 9]]]
